# Slickshot Show-Off: "Whenever you cast a noncreature spell, it gets +2/+0 until end of turn." On turn one (haste) Bot1 casts
# Show-Off (a creature spell, still 1/2 - it was not on the battlefield and is not noncreature), then two Lightning Bolts at
# Bot2: each cast triggers it, so it is 3 and then 5 power and attacks for 5 (6 from the Bolts, 11 in all). On turn two the
# pump has ended at cleanup (power 1). On turn three Bot1 casts Ornithopter, a creature spell, and Bot2 answers with a
# Lightning Bolt of its own: neither pumps it, so it stays at 1 power.

